    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GraeHart</strong> is an immersive 16-bit medieval fantasy RPG where players take on the role of <strong>Percival</strong>, a lone hunter drawn into a battle to protect his village while uncovering the forgotten legacy of his bloodline. As dark forces stir in the realm, Percival begins to unearth long-buried secrets tied to his past\u2014and the curse looming over it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Part One</strong>, players guide Percival through a haunting history, unraveling twisted folklore, battling beasts, and surviving betrayals that threaten to tear his world apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Part Two</strong>, the story deepens with the arrival of <strong>Clara</strong>, Percival\u2019s estranged sister who left home after their mother\u2019s death. On a hunt for their mother's killers, Clara\u2019s path crosses with Percival\u2019s, drawing her into the supernatural conflict surrounding their family. Together, they must confront the sins of their lineage and the horrors awakening across the land.</p>",
